     <actual value="5.00">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">06-12-2022: AOPP did their very best to invite women for the training. They were explicitly invited. The topic of the training was chosen such that women would be interested. Women were invited that knew each other, so that they would feel more confortable. AOPP showed to be very aware of he importance of engaging women in these activities. VU Amsterdam has a well -balanced team in terms of gender (50-50%). The team leader is a women and one of the trainers. The two other trainers are men.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
